{"title":"레스큐 시스템","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=WNT6K/hAC1UTrZ1X/gwaKQ7WJpj4sfgkrZNghT1&filename=th3","synopsis":"신일서의 베테랑 구조대원인 김수혁은\n화재현장에서 구조활동을 하던 중, 건물 잔해에 깔려 사망하게 된다.\n\n죽은 줄 알았던 수혁이 눈을 뜬 곳은 십 년 전의 화재현장.\n어리둥절해하는 수혁의 앞에 정체불명의 상태창이 나타난다.\n\n「구조 대상자들을 모두 구조하라」\n\n과거 구하지 못했던 두 명의 어린 생명을 구한, 수혁에게\n퀘스트 보상으로 새로운 능력과 힘이 주어지고 수혁은 다짐한다.\n\n\"좋아, 이번 생에서는 과거에 구하지 못한 많은 생명을 구하겠어!\"\n\n#회귀 #전문직 #소방관 #구조대 #상태창 #능력남주 #초인","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":219,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":219,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":222,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":209,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":197,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":182,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":131,"change":{"type":"up","amount":51}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":152,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":199,"change":{"type":"down","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":231,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":213,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":210,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":205,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":212,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":212,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":235,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":267,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":251,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":267,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":222,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":227,"change":{"type":"